。もう片方の手には建物を拭くための小さな白い布が握られており、うっかり潰しそうになる。\n千尋は、自分の不自由な巨体について、かわいいような、ちょっと困ったような表情をしている。彼は被害に対して無関心だ。しかし、彼は少し無愛想な言葉を発し、ちらりと下を見るかもしれない。\n\nありがとうございます。\n\n参考\n\n小宮千尋\nhttps://cdn.animenewsnetwork.com/thumbnails/max400x400/cms/news/97587/chihiro.jpg\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/103477132\n\nポーズと街並み\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/49815857", "nc": 137, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sakugami/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 294519, "client_id": 620681, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1acf46cd/uploads/origins/2f43afcc-bcf6-4eff-93f2-12ece0540a77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ec3268f5d264d9bad4464212ca26604", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1acf46cd/uploads/origins/2f43afcc-bcf6-4eff-93f2-12ece0540a77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ec3268f5d264d9bad4464212ca26604, https://si.imgix.net/1acf46cd/uploads/origins/2f43afcc-bcf6-4eff-93f2-12ece0540a77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7488651aa5d1e6f0f6d3d32221f85685 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1acf46cd/uploads/origins/2f43afcc-bcf6-4eff-93f2-12ece0540a77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4c452a1cf9aa1243d697a3fc9c7ee19 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1acf46cd/uploads/origins/2f43afcc-bcf6-4eff-93f2-12ece0540a77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=08f0b8d05592c7655704715a1f1b815c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1acf46cd/uploads/origins/2f43afcc-bcf6-4eff-93f2-12ece0540a77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=08f0b8d05592c7655704715a1f1b815c, https://si.imgix.net/1acf46cd/uploads/origins/2f43afcc-